WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.835
At last Jack reached the bottom of the beanstalk.

2
00:00:14.836 --> 00:00:16.626
He ran into his house.

3
00:00:16.627 --> 00:00:19.583
He was still carrying the golden hen.

4
00:00:19.584 --> 00:00:22.811
"Mother!" he called. "Come quickly!

5
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:26.999
I want to show you something!"

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.535
Mother ran into the room.

7
00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:40.271
Jack placed the golden hen on the table.

8
00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:55.695
"Lay!" he said.

9
00:00:55.696 --> 00:01:03.610
Mother clapped as the hen laid an egg.

10
00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:14.299
"A golden egg!" she said. "Amazing!"

11
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.597
Jack smiled happily.

12
00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:24.203
"Mother will never cry again," he thought.

13
00:01:24.204 --> 00:01:27.374
Time passed.

14
00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:30.242
Mother and Jack were very happy.

15
00:01:30.243 --> 00:01:32.441
They had each other.

16
00:01:32.442 --> 00:01:44.103
And they had plenty of golden eggs.

17
00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:50.243
But after a while, Jack began to worry.

18
00:01:50.244 --> 00:01:55.946
"What if the hen stops laying eggs?" he thought.

19
00:01:55.947 --> 00:02:03.411
"What will we do when that happens?"

20
00:02:03.412 --> 00:02:08.544
That night Jack gazed up at the twinkling star.

21
00:02:08.545 --> 00:02:12.206
He remembered the ogre's big wooden chest.

22
00:02:12.207 --> 00:02:16.233
"That chest is filled with treasure," Jack thought.

23
00:02:16.234 --> 00:02:20.942
"Treasure that the ogre stole from us!

24
00:02:20.943 --> 00:02:30.906
Hmm . . . I wonder . . . "

25
00:02:30.907 --> 00:02:36.428
The next morning Jack woke up early.

26
00:02:36.429 --> 00:02:40.761
He jumped onto the beanstalk and started climbing.

27
00:02:40.762 --> 00:02:47.333
Up, up, up, he climbed.

28
00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:52.277
At last Jack reached the top.

29
00:02:52.278 --> 00:02:54.268
He smiled.

30
00:02:54.269 --> 00:02:58.613
"I'm going back to the ogre's house," he said.

31
00:02:58.614 --> 00:03:03.951
"And I've got a new grand plan!"

